    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Handy the Cat Thief has stolen the clock hand from the Time Museum.</i><br><i>Now, Handy must defeat countless guards and escape using its mysterious power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Snatcher Handy</strong> is a <strong>time-stop bullet-hell Roguelike!</strong><br>Become Handy the cat thief, stop time, and escape the Time Museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/d599b9a7226383073f0fa1363342621e.poster.avif?t=1744042106\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/d599b9a7226383073f0fa1363342621e.webm?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/d599b9a7226383073f0fa1363342621e.mp4?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience unique time-stopping action!</strong><br>With the power of the stolen clock hand, Handy can freeze time. Dodge relentless bullet patterns, vanish from enemy sight, and launch surprise attacks \u2014 all while time stands still. Discover the endless potential of manipulating time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/58f0517618883b51c1ddd526508f9b0c.poster.avif?t=1744042106\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/58f0517618883b51c1ddd526508f9b0c.webm?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/58f0517618883b51c1ddd526508f9b0c.mp4?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal powerful items and grow stronger!</strong><br>Speed up time, summon falling meteors, and more \u2014 the museum is filled with strange (and sometimes dangerous!) items waiting to be snatched. Mix and match your favorites to create your own playstyle and become unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/98775e8209a15d87a4156bbdef72c6e9.poster.avif?t=1744042106\" width=500 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/98775e8209a15d87a4156bbdef72c6e9.webm?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/98775e8209a15d87a4156bbdef72c6e9.mp4?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is about <i>Time</i>!</strong><br>Taking damage, freezing time, and even buying items \u2014 it all costs <i>time</i>. And <i>time</i> is Handy\u2019s lifeline! Use it wisely, steal it from enemies, and survive the chaos.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Handy the Cat Thief has stolen the clock hand from the Time Museum.</i><br><i>Now, Handy must defeat countless guards and escape using its mysterious power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Snatcher Handy</strong> is a <strong>time-stop bullet-hell Roguelike!</strong><br>Become Handy the cat thief, stop time, and escape the Time Museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/d599b9a7226383073f0fa1363342621e.poster.avif?t=1744042106\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/d599b9a7226383073f0fa1363342621e.webm?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/d599b9a7226383073f0fa1363342621e.mp4?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience unique time-stopping action!</strong><br>With the power of the stolen clock hand, Handy can freeze time. Dodge relentless bullet patterns, vanish from enemy sight, and launch surprise attacks \u2014 all while time stands still. Discover the endless potential of manipulating time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/58f0517618883b51c1ddd526508f9b0c.poster.avif?t=1744042106\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/58f0517618883b51c1ddd526508f9b0c.webm?t=1744042106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://s